  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6003.03 Deputy Fire Marshals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6003.03 Deputy Fire Marshals.\n\n(a) Deputy fire marshals, under the direction of the state fire marshal, shall supervise:\n\n(1) The inspection of buildings; and\n\n(2) The investigation of fires and enforcement of state statutes, local ordinances and administrative rules dealing with fire prevention.\n\n(b) In the absence of the state fire marshal, the assistant director of the division of fire safety, or other individual designated by the commissioner, shall assume responsibility for all activities and all duties assigned to the state fire marshal’s office by statute.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6000.html"
